{"version":1,"reference":{"kind":"artifact_content","namespace":"#3656","artifact_type":"_dh-work-item-head-v1","name":"head"},"owner_reference":"#3656","content":"{\"version\":1,\"issue_reference\":\"#3656\",\"parent_revision\":\"400dd4d9327d632e9530fe1a7dcbb2ee25df7fee1c4ed8168e029ab26f4e4939\",\"root_revision\":\"400dd4d9327d632e9530fe1a7dcbb2ee25df7fee1c4ed8168e029ab26f4e4939\",\"body\":\"<!-- backlog-metadata:\\npriority: P1\\ntype: Bug\\nstatus: open\\nadded: 2026-09-19\\n-->\\n\\n## Description\\n\\nRight after a `backlog_groom` append reports `groomed_updated: true`, `backlog_view(map=True)` and `backlog_view(section=..., include_content=false)` can report the pre-write entry count for that section, even with `refresh=true` and after `sync_now()`. `backlog_view(navigate=\\\"<section>.<next index>\\\")` returns the new entry at the same moment.\\n\\nObserved on #3060 on 2026-09-19 by the impact-analyst (Impact Radius append), and in the orchestrator's own reads the same day.\\n\\nImpact: an agent that verifies its write with the map concludes the write failed and retries, which appends a duplicate entry. The impact-analyst recorded a memory note telling itself to verify with navigate= instead \u2014 a workaround in one agent's memory, not a fix.\\n\\nExpected: map and section metadata reflect the same state that navigate= returns.\\n\\n## Context\\n\\n<div><sub>0000-00-00T00:00:00Z</sub>\\n\\n- **Source**: Session observation, re-groom of #3060, 2026-09-19\\n- **Priority**: P1\\n- **Added**: 2026-09-19\\n- **Research questions**: None\\n</div>\\n\",\"digest\":\"cdf9da4313f510a90715dc66fe6277fc70d9aeab13cc3aa0a357b875d0f2ac00\",\"comment_id\":\"IC_kwDOQGimCs8AAAABVoHs1A\"}"}